<title>FRANCE: Swissair names new cargo manager, France.</title>
<headline>Swissair names new cargo manager, France.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair said the airline's Lyon-based Rhone-Alpes cargo manager, Alain Roll, had been appointed cargo manager France, effective February 3.</p>
<p>Roll replaces Didier Mauger who has been appointed Swissair's cargo hub manager at Brussels, the Swiss carrier added.</p>
<p>Jo Bensoussan, Swissair's Strasbourg-based regional manager, replaces Roll at Lyon. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
